  "name": "Herring Catch Landings (Canada)",
  "description": "Parameter Herring catch landings recorded from fish slips Measurement Details Fish slips are submitted to DFO with each vesselメs landing. Catch (tonnes) recorded by geographic location, disposal, date, and gear type. Geographic Area Canadian Pacific Coast Other Comments this web site offers summary catch/landings data in tabular and graphical form for the period 1951-1993 Base Internet/URL ( http://www.pac.dfo.ca/ ) ( http://www.pac.dfo.ca/ops/sa/pages/93grafs.htm ) [ A TCODE project ]\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.",
